        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 3911S-P, Solid Brass Square Sliding Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Solid Brass Square Pocket Door Passage Set is a great choice for modern homes. The square shape is really grown in popularity among home decorators for its clean, sharp design. This Solid Brass Square Sliding Pocket Door Passage Set is available in a wide array of finishes. It comes with everything you need for a pocket door including <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-square-cup-pull-omnia-7504-52\">2 flush pulls</a> and an <a href=\"/products/sliding-pocket-door-edge-pull-omnia-3917\">edge pull</a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe finger edge pull is screwed into the door's edge so that you have something to grip in order to slide the door out of the pocket. The square flush pulls are pressure mounted into the door's face.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/square-privacy-pocket-door-mortise-lock-omnia-3911s\"><b>Square Privacy Pocket Door Lock</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/contemporary-solid-brass-double-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-3911s-dd\"><b>Square Double Pocket Door Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 3911S-P Square Pocket Door Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Solid Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) square flush pulls and an edge pull. For One (1) Door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
